    "translations": {
      "diagram.description.dataflow": "Four kinds of source outside the repository feed the ingest. The manifest names each one; knowledge-ingest.sh fetches and converts them in a read-only job with no agent, writing one Markdown file per page under .lokf/mirror/ and a status per item in the lock. A Sunday pull request is the review; once a person merges it, the Monday librarian derives concepts citing the mirror file and its origin."
